Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Wi‑Fi and Bluetooth open this app's own pages (MacWifiPage.qml,
MacBluetoothPage.qml) instead of KDE's, with KDE's full pages behind
Details…/Advanced… and ‹ back. Wi‑Fi: on/off, the network you're on,
known and other networks with Connect (rescanning while open), Forget.
Bluetooth: on/off, discoverable while open, My Devices (connect,
disconnect, forget) and nearby named devices found while open (Connect
pairs, trusts and connects). New pieces: MacSwitch, MacGroup,
MacGroupRow. MAC_TEST_ENTRY=<entry> opens a sidebar entry at startup.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
